    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "一个看似专业的名字「GoogLeNet / Inception」，背后藏着怎样一个直观问题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "AlexNet 和 VGG 之后，CNN 变得更深也更耗算力。谷歌 团队探索如何提升表示能力，而不是简单放大每一层。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-going-deeper-with-convolutions"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Inception 模块让网络同时使用多种感受野尺寸。1x1 瓶颈层让这种多分支设计在计算上可承受。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-going-deeper-with-convolutions"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 Inception 视为高效模块化 CNN 设计的里程碑。它的长期影响在于强调并行分支、瓶颈层和明确计算权衡，并影响了后来的模块设计与架构搜索。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-going-deeper-with-convolutions"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "「GoogLeNet / Inception」留下的关键，不只是一项成果，而是一种后来可以继续检验、改造和扩展的方法。",
            "sourceIds": [
